Salesforce_Credentials.txt
Security_Token.txt
salesforce-connection.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
PowerBI_Report/
api/

# ── Ignore churn, keep records (mirrors parent policy: docs/2026-06-02-repo-hygiene-design.md) ──
# Throwaway diagnostics — promote to scripts/fix or scripts/analysis if durable
**/_probes/
# Regenerable SF report/query output (rebuild from scripts); keep audit_logs/ as records
data/output/*
!data/output/audit_logs/
# Definitions of scheduled tasks we deliberately removed - records, not output
!data/output/*-scheduled-task-backup.xml
# Stray output dumps written from the wrong working directory (regenerable snapshots)
tracker-lwc/SalesForce/
tracker-lwc/force-app/main/default/SalesForce/
# Run logs
*.log
# Morning SiteTracker chain: per-run state and the single-writer lock, both rewritten daily
scripts/sync/morning-chain-status.json
scripts/sync/morning-chain.lock
# Health monitor's latest-status scratch file (rewritten every run; the .log is history)
scripts/sync/sync-health-status.txt
# Suffixed backups (e.g. .json.bak.scrapped-cleanup)
*.bak
*.bak.*
# sf CLI local source-tracking cache (per-machine, tied to org id, not a record)
.sf/
